{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10135070","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10135070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013507001:0":{"text":"골렘의 힘이 상당히 난잡하네.","source_cn":"魔偶的力量，相当紊乱啊。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1B57401B2FCD8A61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"골렘의 힘이 상당히 난잡하네.","female":"골렘의 힘이 상당히 난잡하네.","variant_male_record_index":"114480","variant_female_record_index":"114481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013507002:0":{"text":"그러게요! 엉망진창인 게 마치... 그... 진저브레드 쿠키를 절반 정도 굽다가 망친, 그런 느낌이에욥!","source_cn":"是啊！乱七八糟的，简直就像是……像是……做姜饼到一半时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD106C0A6867205C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013507003:0":{"text":"진저브레드 쿠키? 해미, 배고파?","source_cn":"姜饼？漫漫，肚子饿了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5639D2C3FBB5F05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013507004:0":{"text":"바, 바보 치피, 배고픈 게 아니라! 난 그냥 그 골렘들이 뭔가... 만들다 만 반제품? 같은 느낌이 들었다구!","source_cn":"笨、笨蛋满满，我才不是饿了！只是想说，那些魔偶有种……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5E83D0E59EC388A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"m